msgid "Tailscale"
msgstr "Tailscale"

msgid "Join this router to a tailnet: reach home devices without port forwarding, route remote subnets, or use a tailnet exit node."
msgstr "把路由器加入 tailnet：无需端口映射即可远程访问家里设备、访问对端子网，或使用 tailnet 出口节点。"

msgid "The generated config adds endpoints[type=tailscale], a MagicDNS DNS server and preferred_by rules."
msgstr "生成的配置会加入 endpoints[type=tailscale]、MagicDNS DNS 服务器和 preferred_by 规则。"

msgid "Requires a sing-box 1.14.4+ binary built with with_tailscale/with_gvisor (official releases are)."
msgstr "需要启用 with_tailscale/with_gvisor 编译的 sing-box 1.14.4+ 二进制（官方 release 默认包含）。"

