msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "Enabled; save the configuration"
msgstr "已启用，请保存配置"

msgid "Saved; restart the service"
msgstr "已保存，请重启服务"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Login URL"
msgstr "登录链接"

msgid "No login URL yet. Restart the service, then check Logs for \"Waiting for authentication\"."
msgstr "暂无登录链接。重启服务后在「日志」中查找 “Waiting for authentication”。"

msgid "Open login page"
msgstr "打开登录页面"

msgid "No login URL yet. Restart the service and check the log."
msgstr "暂无登录链接，请重启服务后查看日志。"

msgid "Enable Tailscale"
msgstr "启用 Tailscale"

msgid "When enabled, the router becomes a tailnet node. Traffic to tailnet peers, MagicDNS names and accepted subnet routes is routed into the endpoint before the private-IP direct rule."
msgstr "启用后路由器成为 tailnet 节点。发往 tailnet 节点、MagicDNS 域名和已接受子网路由的流量会在「私有 IP 直连」规则之前送入该端点。"

msgid "Auth key"
msgstr "认证密钥"

msgid "Recommended for unattended routers (tskey-auth-...). Leave empty to log in interactively through the URL printed in the core log."
msgstr "无人值守路由器建议填写（tskey-auth-...）。留空则需通过核心日志打印的链接交互登录。"

msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "主机名"

msgid "Name shown in the Tailscale admin console. Defaults to the system hostname."
msgstr "在 Tailscale 管理台中显示的名称。默认为系统主机名。"

msgid "System hostname"
msgstr "系统主机名"

msgid "State directory"
msgstr "状态目录"

msgid "Node identity and keys are stored here; it must survive reboots. Relative paths resolve under /etc/singbox-lite."
msgstr "保存节点身份和密钥，必须持久化。相对路径基于 /etc/singbox-lite。"

msgid "Accept subnet routes"
msgstr "接受子网路由"

msgid "Use subnets advertised by other tailnet nodes. Their ranges are matched by the preferred_by route rule."
msgstr "使用其他 tailnet 节点通告的子网。其网段由 preferred_by 路由规则匹配。"

msgid "Advertise routes"
msgstr "通告路由"

msgid "Comma-separated CIDRs advertised to the tailnet so peers can reach your LAN, e.g. 192.168.1.0/24. Approve them in the Tailscale admin console. The default route is not allowed here."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的 CIDR，通告给 tailnet 供对端访问你的 LAN，例如 192.168.1.0/24。需在 Tailscale 管理台批准。此处不允许默认路由。"

msgid "Advertise as exit node"
msgstr "通告为出口节点"

msgid "Let other tailnet devices send all their traffic through this router. Approve the exit node in the Tailscale admin console."
msgstr "允许其他 tailnet 设备把全部流量经本路由器转发。需在 Tailscale 管理台批准。"

msgid "Use exit node"
msgstr "使用出口节点"

msgid "Name or IP of a tailnet exit node. Only traffic routed to the endpoint uses it; enable the option below to make it the default egress."
msgstr "tailnet 出口节点的名称或 IP。只有被路由到该端点的流量才会使用；打开下一项可把它设为默认出口。"

msgid "Allow LAN access through exit node"
msgstr "出口节点下仍可访问 LAN"

msgid "Keep local LAN destinations reachable directly while the exit node is in use."
msgstr "使用出口节点时，本机 LAN 目标仍直接可达。"

msgid "Default egress via exit node"
msgstr "默认出口走出口节点"

msgid "Make the tailnet exit node the route final: traffic not matched by any rule set leaves through it instead of the default proxy group. Requires an exit node above."
msgstr "把 tailnet 出口节点设为 route final：未被任何规则集匹配的流量改从它出去，而不是默认代理组。需先填写出口节点。"

msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"
